msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-longbowf405wing.rst:99
#: bc15c217a8ec40dfa35bade277c69088
msgid "Channels within the same group need to use the same output rate. If any channel in a group uses DShot then all channels in that group would need to use DShot."
msgstr ""

